================ generator: dilation ================
  eta_old = eta ;  x_old = [x*(b*eps*s + 1), y*(b*eps*s + 1), z*(b*eps*s + 1)]
  induced first-order zero-mode fields (coefficient of s):
     Phi1   = -b
  Poisson conditions on zero mode: div omega = 0 ; div h = [0, 0, 0]
  observer event (new coords): {'dxo2_1': -2*b*dxo1_1*s + dxo2_1, 'dxo2_2': -2*b*dxo1_2*s + dxo2_2, 'dxo2_3': -2*b*dxo1_3*s + dxo2_3}
  zero-mode parts of ray functionals: K = [b*n1, b*n2, b*n3] 
      D = [b*n1*(eta - eta_o_bar), b*n2*(eta - eta_o_bar), b*n3*(eta - eta_o_bar)]
